  "description": "Outline planning application (all matters reserved except for access and scale) for demolition of existing buildings and redevelopment to provide a mixed-use development comprising a new pocket park, the erection of a flexible Purpose-Built Student Accommodation (PBSA) or Large-Scale Purpose-Built Shared Living (LSPBSL) use building with access off Coles Green Road, an industrial building with access off Waterloo Road and associated parking and landscaping.Further detailed explanation of the proposal for consultation purposes (not forming part of the formal description of development set out above):   The proposal includes two blocks up to 28 storeys in height (up to 155m AOD); comprising: up to 479 Purpose Built Student Accommodation rooms or to accommodate up to 451 Large Scale Purpose Built Shared Living units building and industrial building up to three storeys (up to 70.80m AOD).",
